# POD to PD commmunication

we need to use service for pod to pod commmunication
Since pod is ephemeral we cant use pod ip as DNS, K8 is giving us option to use services.
1. pod to communication
2. load balancing

pod -> service -> endpoints(podip:container-port)

1. clusterIP -> internal to kubernetes
2. nodePort -> expose pod to outside world in internet
	http://ec2-ip:nodePort -> clusterIP -> pod
	30000–32767 -> ephemeral ports for nodePort
	
	k8 opens one ephemeral nodePort in all the worker nodes, if you hit any worker node on that nodePort, traffic will be forwarded to clusterIP and then to the pod
3. LoadBalancer

